{
  "$comment": "見本「サークルの活動」の採点のシナリオ。時計を日本時間の 2026-09-15 に固定し、メンバー 3 人と、**今月（2026 年 9 月）の**活動 3 件を入れる。**アプリ全体の集計（scope: app）は `date: { within: this_month }` で今月に絞る**（Issue #178）ので、活動の日付はすべて 9 月にしてある——「今月」の境目は日本時間で決まる。アプリ全体の値は行ではないので、この views には現れない——unit テスト（spec-engine・data-api・host）が確かめる。",
  "sample": "dashboard",
  "clock": "2026-09-15T12:00:00+09:00",
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "メンバー A を足す",
      "action": "addMember",
      "input": { "name": "A" },
      "expect": { "accepted": true, "bind": "A" }
    },
    {
      "name": "メンバー B を足す",
      "action": "addMember",
      "input": { "name": "B" },
      "expect": { "accepted": true, "bind": "B" }
    },
    {
      "name": "メンバー C を足す",
      "action": "addMember",
      "input": { "name": "C" },
      "expect": { "accepted": true, "bind": "C" }
    },
    {
      "name": "練習を記録する（2026-09-10。A・B・C が参加。3000 円）",
      "action": "addActivity",
      "input": { "kind": "practice", "date": "2026-09-10", "attendees": ["$A", "$B", "$C"], "cost": 3000 },
      "expect": { "accepted": true }
    },
    {
      "name": "飲み会を記録する（2026-09-12。A・B が参加。5000 円）",
      "action": "addActivity",
      "input": { "kind": "party", "date": "2026-09-12", "attendees": ["$A", "$B"], "cost": 5000 },
      "expect": { "accepted": true }
    },
    {
      "name": "試合を記録する（2026-09-14。A が参加。2000 円）",
      "action": "addActivity",
      "input": { "kind": "match", "date": "2026-09-14", "attendees": ["$A"], "cost": 2000 },
      "expect": { "accepted": true }
    }
  ],
  "views": {
    "activities": [
      { "kind": "practice", "date": "2026-09-10", "attendees": ["$A", "$B", "$C"], "cost": 3000, "attendeeCount": 3 },
      { "kind": "party", "date": "2026-09-12", "attendees": ["$A", "$B"], "cost": 5000, "attendeeCount": 2 },
      { "kind": "match", "date": "2026-09-14", "attendees": ["$A"], "cost": 2000, "attendeeCount": 1 }
    ]
  }
}
